import site/games/farm/document.dl
import site/games/farm/simulation.dl

set original to the initial website farm document
set invalid to the website farm snapshot of original
set entry to the JSON value at index 0 in (the JSON member named "roles" in invalid)
set JSON member (JSON flag "needsRebuild" is true) in entry
set rejected to the website farm document from invalid
require condition (rejected's error is not empty) reporting "A saved role requested rebuilding without a saved program."
free invalid
set worker to the item at 0 in (original's world's workers)
set role to the item at 0 in (original's roles)
set role's applied to "loop forever:\n    turn right"
set role's source to role's applied + "\n# Keep this unapplied draft 🌽"
free website farm plan the address of (role's program)
set role's program to the website farm plan from (the string form of "LOOP|-1\nDO|1|3|-1|-2|\nEND") dropping 0 source lines
set role's prepared to true
set role's needs rebuilding to true
set role's generation to 13
assign website farm role role to worker
advance the website farm world (original's world) using roles (original's roles) with workers running true
set worker's held to true
set original's world's player's held to true
set (original's world's chickens' data)'s held to true
set saved to the website farm snapshot of original
require condition ((worker's held) and (original's world's player's held)) reporting "Saving released live pointer capture."
require condition ((original's world's chickens' data)'s held) reporting "Saving released a live chicken."
set {role data} to the JSON value at index 0 in (the JSON member named "roles" in saved)
require condition (role data lacks JSON member named "generation") reporting "A save persisted a transient role request generation."
set loaded to the website farm document from saved
require condition (loaded's error is empty) reporting "A new Farm snapshot failed validation."
free saved
free website farm document original
# The loaded game owns every string, list, plan and reference after both its
# JSON source and the original game have been released.
set document to loaded's document
set worker to the item at 0 in (document's world's workers)
set role to the item at 0 in (document's roles)
require condition ((role's generation = 0) and (role's needs rebuilding)) reporting "Loading retained a request generation or lost pending rebuilding."
require condition ((role's source ends with "# Keep this unapplied draft 🌽") and (role's applied = "loop forever:\n    turn right")) reporting "Loading lost an applied program or an unapplied draft."
require condition ((worker's held = false) and ((document's world's player's held = false) and ((document's world's chickens' data)'s held = false))) reporting "Loading retained pointer capture."
require condition ((worker's direction = 1) and (worker's routine's position = 2)) reporting "Loading restarted an active routine."
advance the website farm world (document's world) using roles (document's roles) with workers running true
require condition ((worker's direction = 2) and (document's world's tick = 2)) reporting "A loaded loop failed to resume."
set snapshot to the website farm snapshot of document
set another to the website farm document from snapshot
require condition (another's error is empty) reporting "A resumed Farm snapshot failed validation."
free snapshot
free website farm document document
free website farm document (another's document)
print line "Farm snapshots preserve active programs and drafts, release transient capture, and own their loaded data."
